&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;委員長：代表取締役社長&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;内部監査部、取締役、執行役員&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;各管理部門長&lt;/p&gt;
